     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Gavin,<div>Thank you for the great work on TitanCNA! </div><div>I&#39;ve ran TitanCNA 1.4.0 on my data (1 healthy control, 3 patients) and did see a strange behaviour in the WGS dataset (50X Illumina X)  i&#39;m using. (Demo runs just fine and with same/similar results as shown on webpage)</div><div><br></div><div>All regions in my patient files are marked as having a duplication? Using other methods like FreeC, this is not happening?</div><div><br></div><div>There is one difference I&#39;ve found in the params: the S_Dbw values are extremely low compared to the demo/example:</div><div>Do I need to change something to correct this?</div><div><br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">Normal contamination estimate:<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0.37</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">Average tumour ploidy estimate:<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>2.60</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">Clonal cluster cellular prevalence Z=2:<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0.9188 0.7047</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">Genotype binomial means for clonal cluster Z=1:<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0.50 0.70 0.79 0.53 0.84 0.61 0.87 0.68 0.54 0.89 0.73 0.58</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">Genotype Gaussian means for clonal cluster Z=1:<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>-1.51 -0.75 -0.25 -0.25 0.12 0.12 0.41 0.41 0.41 0.65 0.65 0.65</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">Genotype binomial means for clonal cluster Z=2:<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0.50 0.64 0.72 0.52 0.77 0.59 0.81 0.65 0.53 0.83 0.70 0.57</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">Genotype Gaussian means for clonal cluster Z=2:<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>-1.10 -0.61 -0.25 -0.25 0.04 0.04 0.28 0.28 0.28 0.49 0.49 0.49</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">Genotype Gaussian variance:<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0.0018 0.0266 0.0200 0.0200 0.0147 0.0147 0.0192 0.0192 0.0192 0.3212 0.3212 0.3212</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">Number of iterations:<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>7</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">Log likelihood:<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>-7672873.2520</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">S_Dbw <a href=\"http://dens.bw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://dens.bw&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793235473872000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0iHi3WIKqXcgWhiQZmibXv\">dens.bw</a>:<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0.0056 </blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">S_Dbw scat:<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0.0442 </blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">S_Dbw validity index:<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0.0498 </blockquote></blockquote><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>And this is my script:</div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\"># modified example from: <a href=\"http://compbio.bccrc.ca/software/titan/titan-running-titancna/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://compbio.bccrc.ca/software/titan/titan-running-titancna/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793235473872000&amp;usg=AOvVaw15okkcLqjc5udThHHjH3Un\">http://compbio.bccrc.ca/software/titan/titan-running-titancna/</a></blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">library(optparse)</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\"><br></blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">library(TitanCNA)</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">library(SNPchip)  ## use this library to plot chromosome idiogram</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\"><br></blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">library(doMC)</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">registerDoMC()</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\"><br></blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\"><br></blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">option_list &lt;- list(</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">    make_option(c(&quot;-i&quot;, &quot;--input&quot;), dest=&quot;input_allels&quot;),</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">    make_option(c(&quot;-w&quot;, &quot;--inputwig&quot;), dest=&quot;input_wig&quot;),</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\"><br></blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">    make_option(c(&quot;-b&quot;, &quot;--normalwig&quot;), dest=&quot;normal_wig&quot;),</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\"><br></blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">    make_option(c(&quot;-a&quot;, &quot;--gcwig&quot;), dest=&quot;gc_wig&quot;),</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">    make_option(c(&quot;-m&quot;, &quot;--mapwig&quot;), dest=&quot;map_wig&quot;),</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\"><br></blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">    make_option(c(&quot;-o&quot;, &quot;--output&quot;), dest=&quot;output&quot;),</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\"><br></blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">    make_option(c(&quot;-t&quot;, &quot;--threads&quot;), default=1, type=&quot;integer&quot;, dest=&quot;threads&quot;),</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\"><br></blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\"><br></blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">    make_option(c(&quot;-c&quot;, &quot;--clusters&quot;), default=2, type=&quot;integer&quot;, dest=&quot;clusters&quot;),</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">    make_option(c(&quot;-n&quot;, &quot;--copynumbers&quot;), default=5, type=&quot;integer&quot;, dest=&quot;copynumbers&quot;),</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\"><br></blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">    make_option(c(&quot;-p&quot;, &quot;--ploidy&quot;), default=2, type=&quot;integer&quot;, dest=&quot;ploidy&quot;),</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">    make_option(c(&quot;-q&quot;, &quot;--normalproportion&quot;), default=0.5, type=&quot;integer&quot;, dest=&quot;normalproportion&quot;)</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">    )</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\"><br></blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">parser &lt;- OptionParser(usage = &quot;%prog [options] file&quot;, option_list=option_list)</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">opt = parse_args(parser)</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\"><br></blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">## setup threaded</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">options(cores= opt$threads)</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\"><br></blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\"># config the input</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\"><br></blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">infile &lt;- opt$input_allels</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">tumWig &lt;- opt$input_wig</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\"><br></blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">normWig &lt;- opt$normal_wig</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">gc      &lt;- opt$gc_wig</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">map     &lt;- opt$map_wig</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\"><br></blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\"><br></blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">numClusters &lt;- opt$clusters</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">params &lt;- loadDefaultParameters(copyNumber=opt$copynumbers, numberClonalClusters=numClusters, symmetric=TRUE)</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">params$normalParams$n_0     &lt;- opt$normalproportion     #set initial normal proportion to 0.5</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">params$ploidyParams$phi_0   &lt;- opt$ploidy               #set initial ploidy to 2 (diploid)</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\"><br></blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\"><br></blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\"><br></blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\"># load data</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">data &lt;- loadAlleleCounts(infile, genomeStyle = &quot;UCSC&quot;)</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\"><br></blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">cnData &lt;- correctReadDepth(tumWig,normWig,gc,map, genomeStyle = &quot;UCSC&quot;)</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">logR &lt;- getPositionOverlap(data$chr,data$posn,cnData)</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">data$logR &lt;- log(2^logR)</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">rm(logR,cnData)</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\"><br></blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">chromosomes &lt;- unique(data$chr)</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">chromosomes &lt;- chromosomes[ chromosomes != &quot;chrY&quot; ]</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">chromosomes &lt;- chromosomes[ chromosomes != &quot;chrM&quot; ]</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">chromosomes &lt;- chromosomes[ chromosomes != &quot;Y&quot; ]</blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">chromosomes &lt;- chromosomes[ chromosomes != &quot;M&qu